&lt;h4 class="smt_head5"&gt; &lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ｃ．販売実績&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;当連結会計年度の販売実績は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:0.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_left" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:467.9pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:212.7pt;min-width:212.7pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:127.6pt;min-width:127.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:127.6pt;min-width:127.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:22.7pt;min-height:22.7pt;"&gt;
